    "text_full": "Solutions\nTools\nIntegrations\nResources\nPricing\nGet a demo\nLogin\nRegister\n120+ DATA POINTS PER SKU, IN MINUTES\nFrom a supplier catalog to a profitable order\n\nUpload a supplier price list and get FBA and FBM profitability, Keepa historical data, competition intelligence, and risk flags for every product in your catalog.\n\nGet Started\nHOW IT WORKS\nThree steps between a supplier file and a purchase order\n\nNo manual lookups. No spreadsheets. Results appear as the file processes.\n\n1\nUpload and map your price list\n\nChoose your marketplace, upload a file, map to a supplier. Confirm the columns: identifiers, cost of goods, supplier SKU, case quantity.\n\n2\nAnalyze and find the leads\n\nEvery identifier is matched to Amazon and enriched with 120+ data points. Filter by any data point and save your setup as a reusable view.\n\n3\nMove straight to the purchase order\n\nTag products, check restrictions in bulk, or jump to brand analysis from any row. When your shortlist is ready, push it to a Purchase Order in 2 clicks.\n\nWHY IT MATTERS\nAnalyzing supplier catalogs was hours of spreadsheet work\n\nMost sellers still look products up one by one. Price List Analyzer processes the entire file automatically.\n\nDIRECT ORDERS\nFrom shortlist to profitable purchase order\n\nWhen your analysis is done, select the products worth ordering and create a Purchase Order for that supplier. Cost, SKU, and case quantity carry through from the price list. Nothing to re-enter, no switching tools.\n\nCALCULATION CONTROL\nNumbers built on your actual cost structure\n\nGet profit, ROI, margin, and break-even price for every SKU automatically in minutes. Configure inbound shipping, prep fees, 3PL costs, VAT, and more. Choose to calculate from the current Buy Box price or 30, 90, or 180-day historical averages.\n\nSAVED VIEWS\nYour table setup, ready for every price list\n\nSave your column layout and active filters as a named view and have it active in any price list. Work with exactly the data you need every time, no reconfiguring, no hunting through columns every time a new catalog lands.\n\nCONTINUOUS ANALYSIS\nEvery price list builds your supplier record\n\nEvery price list you upload adds products and offers to your supplier profile automatically. New uploads from the same supplier update existing offers — so your data stays current without manual work. One supplier, all their products, full history.\n\nWHAT'S INCLUDED\nEverything Price List Analyzer handles\n\nThe details that matter when you're working through a supplier catalog.\n\nFBA & FBM profitability\n\nProfit, ROI, margin, break-even price, and max COG for both fulfillment methods.\n\nHistorical data\n\nBuy Box averages, BSR trends, and Amazon's share over 30, 90, and 180 days.\n\nMatching Rules\n\nAlways or never match any identifier–ASIN pair. Set rules from inside the price list.\n\nSaveable filter views\n\nSave any filter setup as a named view. Load it on any price list in one click.\n\nUniversal tags & notes\n\nTag any ASIN once. The tag appears across all tools wherever that ASIN shows up.\n\nBulk restriction check\n\nCheck eligibility across the full list — or a subset — in one action.\n\nReanalyze on demand\n\nRefresh data on any price list without re-uploading the file.\n\nDirect PO creation\n\nSelect your shortlist and push it to a Purchase Order. SKU and cost carry through.\n\nWORKFLOW\nPrice List Analyzer is one step. These tools make it count\n\nAnalysis connects to action. No copy-pasting between tools.\n\nSource\nSuppliers\n\nPrice lists are stored inside supplier profiles. SKU and case quantity carry through the entire workflow.\n\nSource\nPurchase Orders\n\nCreate a Purchase Order from your filtered shortlist. SKU and cost are already there.\n\nSource\nProduct Database\n\nApproved products flow into your Product Database with supplier offers attached.\n\nDiscover\nBrand Analyzer\n\nJump from any row to a full brand analysis before committing to a product.\n\nCOMPLETE YOUR WORKFLOW\nThe pipeline starts before the price list\n\nFind suppliers, validate products, and list what you've ordered all in the same platform.\n\nAI Supplier Finder\n\nFind suppliers by brand or ASIN before you have a catalog to upload.\n\nAnalyze\nSeller Spy\n\nTrack competitor storefronts and uncover what they're sourcing.\n\nDiscover\nLister\n\nTake products from your Purchase Orders and list them on Amazon in bulk.\n\nList\nBrowser Extension\n\nCheck margins and validate products on any Amazon page.\n\nDiscover\nFrequently Asked Questions\nVisit Help Center\nHow do I find profitable products in a wholesale supplier catalog?\nHow does Price List Analyzer calculate FBA and FBM profit?\nWhich Amazon marketplaces does Price List Analyzer support?\nCan I check Amazon selling restrictions in bulk?\nHow do I control which Amazon listing a supplier product matches to?\nCan I reuse the same filters across multiple price lists?\nCan I use Price List Analyzer for online arbitrage?\nReady to find profitable products in any supplier catalog?\n\nUpload a price list and get profitability, demand, and risk data for every product — in minutes.\n\nGet Started\nNAVIGATION\nHome\nPricing\nDownload\nSOLUTIONS\nOnline Arbitrage\nWholesale\nDropshipping\nAgencies\nPRODUCTS\nPrice List Analyzer\nLister\nPurchase Orders\nSuppliers\nWarehouses\nSeller Assistant Extension\nIP-Alert by Seller Assistant\nVPN by Seller Assistant\nBulk Restriction Checker\nSeller Spy\nBrand Analyzer\nFREE TOOLS\nASIN Lookup\nIP-Alert Lookup\nSupplier Finder\nASIN to UPC\nUPC to ASIN\nEAN to ASIN\nFEATURES\nFBM & FBA Calculator\nVAT Calculator\nAmazon IP-Alert\nSide Panel View\nAmazon Quick View\nStorefront Widget\nAlerts & Flags\nRestrictions Checker\nSales Estimator\nOffers\nVariation Viewer\nStock Checker\nASIN Grabber\nSub-Accounts for VAs\nExport to Google Sheets\nNotes\nALTERNATIVES\nAnalyzer.Tools Alternative\nScan Unlimited Alternative\nSmartScout Alternative\nRevSeller Alternative\nBuyBotPro Alternative\nAZInsight Alternative\nSellerAmp Alternative\nIP-Alert Alternative\nDS Quick View Alternative\nPARTNERS\nAffiliate Program\nPartners\nAmazon Experts\nPress Kit\nRESOURCES\nBlog\nGet a Demo\nHelp Center\nOffice Hours\nNews & Updates\nProduct Roadmap\nReviews\nINTEGRATIONS\nZapier\nMake\nAirtable\nn8n\nGoogle Sheets\nSeller Central\nPrep Centers\nAPI\nOTHER LINKS\nIP-Alert by Seller Assistant\nLANGUAGE\n🇬🇧 English\n🇷🇺 Русский\n🇪🇸 Español\n🇹🇷 Türkçe\n\nCopyright © 2019-2026 Linen Art, LLC. All rights reserved.\nAmazon and all related marks are trademarks of Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates.\n\nTerms of Use\n|\nPrivacy Policy\n|\nCookie Policy\n|\nRefund Policy"
